<H3>
<CENTER>
<FONT COLOR="#FFFF00">Turbo Charging</FONT>
</CENTER></H3>


<A HREF="nikos_korovilas.html">Nikos Korovilas</A> from Greece has fitted
the 20V Turbo engine from the Fiat Coupe into his Tipo 1.4.
<P>
<A HREF="../owners/moshe_tevet.html">Moshe Tevet</A> from Israel fitted a turbo
charger to his Tipo 16V. His friend <A HREF="../owners/alex_neagu.html">Alex Neagu</A>
is also fitting a turbo charger to his Tipo 16V. Read all about the installation
and parts used on their pages.
<P>
The ignition system wiring diagram for a
<A HREF="../technical/wiring_tipo.html" target="_blank">Fiat Tipo 16V</A> is
very similar to that for a
<A HREF="../technical/wiring_integrale.html" target="_blank">Lancia Integrale 16V</A>.
I've shown the extra components and wiring in red.
<P>
<A HREF="../tuning/tuning.html#avanti">Avanti Motorsport</A> have turbo charged a Tipo 16V in the UK. Currently (November 2000)
it's being run in so it's early days and not much information is available.
<P>
<A HREF="../articles/cicale/cicale.html">Cicale Racing</A> in Italy
fitted a Turbo charger to a Tipo 16V for a client.
<P>
Here are a few Tipo 16V owners <A HREF="../faq/faq.html#turbo_charging">views</A> (right or wrong)
about various turbo charging techniques.

<P>
<IMG SRC="../../images/new.gif" ALIGN=TOP BORDER=0 HEIGHT=21 WIDTH=32 ALT="New">I'm going the turbo route myself. Read all about it <A HREF="transplant.html">here</A>.

</FONT> 
